---

<ContentLayout
  title="Team – SMJ Regio Wegweiser"
  description="Die, die das hier möglich machen: junge Leiter, erfahrene Begleiter und das Prinzip Jugend leitet Jugend."
>
  <section class="texture-paper relative bg-paper pb-24 pt-40 text-forest-950">
    <Container>
      <Eyebrow label="Team" muted />
      <h1 class="display display-xl mt-6 text-forest-950">
        Die, die das hier<br />
        <span class="text-orange">möglich machen.</span>
      </h1>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-forest-950 py-16">
    <Container size="wide">
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden border-2 border-paper/15 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#161f18] via-forest-900 to-forest-950 p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 shadow-2xl">
        <!-- Topo & Atmospheric Ambient Backlight -->
        <div class="texture-topo absolute inset-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true" />
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-64 bg-radial from-orange/20 via-orange/5 to-transparent blur-3xl opacity-60" aria-hidden="true" />
        
        <!-- Header badge -->
        <div class="relative z-10 mb-8 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 border-b border-paper/10 pb-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-end">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-orange animate-pulse"></span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-orange">// DIE REGIO WEGWEISER CREW</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="display mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl uppercase text-paper">
              Gemeinsam für das <span class="text-orange">nächste Abenteuer.</span>
            </h2>
          </div>
          <span class="stamp-distressed font-mono text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] border-orange/80 bg-forest-950 text-orange px-3 py-1 self-start sm:self-auto">
            Leiterrunde 2026
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Cutout Group Image Stage -->
        <div class="relative z-10 flex w-full items-end justify-center pt-2">
          <img
            src="/team/team-group.png"
            alt="Das gesamte Leitungsteam der SMJ Regio Wegweiser"
            class="max-h-[520px] w-full max-w-5xl object-contain drop-shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.85)]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-forest-950 pb-28 pt-4 text-paper">
    <Container size="wide">
      <div class="mb-14 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 border-b border-paper/10 pb-8 md:flex-row md:items-end">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-orange animate-pulse"></span>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-orange">Expeditions-Crew & Leiterrunde</p>
          </div>
          <h2 class="display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl mt-3 text-paper uppercase">
            Die Köpfe hinter <span class="text-orange">dem Abenteuer.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="max-w-md font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-paper/70">
          // JUGEND LEITET JUGEND<br />
          Verantwortung, Vertrauen und echte Einsätze vor Ort. Du erreichst jeden von uns direkt.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Hero Character Roster Grid - Exactly 3 in a row -->
      <div id="team-members-container" class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {
          teamMembers.map((member, idx) => (
            <article class="team-member-card group relative flex min-h-[620px] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden border-2 border-paper/15 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#161f18] via-forest-900 to-forest-950 p-6 sm:p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-orange hover:shadow-[0_25px_60px_rgba(255,90,31,0.2)] hover:-translate-y-2">
              <!-- Topo & Stage Background Textures -->
              <div class="texture-topo absolute inset-0 opacity-25 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true" />
              
              <!-- Giant Watermark Number in Background -->
              <span class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-4 -left-2 select-none font-mono text-[9rem] font-black leading-none text-paper/[0.04] transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-orange/[0.08]" aria-hidden="true">
                {String(idx + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
              </span>

              <!-- Warm Radial Spotlight behind Character -->
              <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-16 h-80 rounded-full bg-radial from-orange/20 via-orange/5 to-transparent blur-3xl opacity-50 transition-all duration-700 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-110" aria-hidden="true" />

              <!-- Top Card Header / Badges -->
              <div class="relative z-20 flex items-start justify-between gap-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange">
                  // {`CREW ${String(idx + 1).padStart(2, '0')}`}
                </span>
                <span class="stamp-distressed text-[0.62rem] border-orange/80 bg-forest-950/90 text-orange px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">
                  {member.badge}
                </span>
              </div>

              <!-- Cutout Hero Character Stage -->
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-end justify-center pointer-events-none overflow-hidden pb-16 pt-10">
                <img
                  src={member.image}
                  alt={`Porträt von ${member.name} (${member.role})`}
                  class="relative z-10 h-[88%] w-auto max-w-[95%] object-contain object-bottom transition-all duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-108 group-hover:-translate-y-2"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
              </div>

              <!-- Smooth Dark Layered Gradient Overlay (over image z-10, under text z-20) -->
              <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-80 bg-gradient-to-t from-forest-950 from-40% via-forest-950/90 via-75% to-transparent z-15" aria-hidden="true" />

              <!-- Bottom Overlaid Character Info -->
              <div class="relative z-20 mt-auto pt-24">
                <p class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange">
                  {member.role}
                </p>
                <h3 class="display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-paper tracking-wide uppercase mt-1 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-orange">
                  {member.name}
                </h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/75">
                  {member.description}
                </p>

                <div class="mt-6 border-t border-paper/15 pt-4">
                  <a
                    href={`mailto:${member.email}`}
                    class="group/btn inline-flex w-full items-center justify-between border border-paper/20 bg-forest-950/80 px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper transition-all duration-300 hover:border-orange hover:bg-orange hover:text-forest-950"
                  >
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
                      <Mail class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-orange transition-colors group-hover/btn:text-forest-950" />
                      <span>E-Mail schreiben</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="text-orange transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 group-hover/btn:text-forest-950">→</span>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-forest-900 py-20">
    <Container size="wide" class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="border border-paper/15 bg-forest-950 p-8">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Jugend leitet Jugend</p>
        <h2 class="display display-sm text-paper">Kein Steriler Dienstplan</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/75">
          Unsere Leiter sind zum großen Teil selbst in der SMJ groß geworden. Sie übernehmen Verantwortung in einem Team, das sie kennt und trägt – begleitet von erfahrenen Erwachsenen, die im Hintergrund bereitstehen.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="border border-paper/15 bg-forest-950 p-8">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Finanzen & Zentrale Anlaufstelle</p>
        <h2 class="display display-sm text-paper">Transparenz & Kontakt</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/75">
          Für Lagerbeiträge, Zuschüsse, Materialkasse und allgemeine Fragen steht dir unsere Finanz- und Organisationsleitung zur Seite (<strong class="text-paper">Julian Hupe</strong> · <a href="mailto:julian.hupe@smj-wegweiser.de" class="text-orange hover:underline font-mono text-xs">julian.hupe@smj-wegweiser.de</a>).
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <Button href="/kontakt/" variant="primary">
            Kontakt aufnehmen
          </Button>
        </div>
      </article>
    </Container>
  </section>
</ContentLayout>

<script>
  import '../../scripts/animations/team-stamps'
</script>

